; CARRIER CONFINEMENT — the carrier (a Door) opens only through the grant (a Relay); nothing else can
; reach its one input port. Confinement is the topology, not a promise.
[pulser:cc_worker](every 1){sig_out}
[relay:cc_grant]{sig_in, sig_out}
[door:cc_carrier]{sig_in}

[cc_worker] --sig--> [cc_grant]
[cc_grant] --sig--> [cc_carrier]
